[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9060.309, "timestamp": "02:31:00", "text": "[笑声和倒吸气声]，都是些蠢事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9062.389, "timestamp": "02:31:02", "text": "。 糟糕。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9065.51, "timestamp": "02:31:05", "text": "但是，是的，自从我大概在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9069.75, "timestamp": "02:31:09", "text": "10岁左右停止这样做之后，就一直这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9073.349, "timestamp": "02:31:13", "text": "不。是的。 再加上第 11 和第 12 个。 不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9076.389, "timestamp": "02:31:16", "text": "第十。  11月12日 是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9080.07, "timestamp": "02:31:20", "text": "等等，10年级和16年级差不多，对吧？  11 12 就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9084.29, "timestamp": "02:31:24", "text": "18。哦，我刚刚也意识到了[笑声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9095.51, "timestamp": "02:31:35", "text": "我以前从来不想出去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9097.67, "timestamp": "02:31:37", "text": "旅行的原因是，我得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9100.55, "timestamp": "02:31:40", "text": "直播这个直播那个。 我必须"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9103.75, "timestamp": "02:31:43", "text": "积极行动起来。 我必须保持一致。  [音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9106.71, "timestamp": "02:31:46", "text": "所有这些。 那大概就是我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9109.99, "timestamp": "02:31:49", "text": "借口吧，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9113.27, "timestamp": "02:31:53", "text": "比如参加漫展之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9116.23, "timestamp": "02:31:56", "text": "我觉得我父母现在不会允许我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9118.71, "timestamp": "02:31:58", "text": "出去旅行了。"}]